Notes: Each file is the station's whole research-quality hourly record (Brest since 1846); the build
  reads 2018 only, the last year every station has. Stations chosen for their kinds of tide: Brest
  semidiurnal and large, Marseille almost none (Mediterranean), Pensacola diurnal (Gulf of Mexico),
  Manila mixed, Fremantle diurnal and small (southern hemisphere).

